#Linux
Huaputa tuhi: (Tono ls -la), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: (Ara /home gabor Desktop), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: (Ara /root: ['my\\ documents'], business presentations), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: ((Tono ls: ['my\\ documents']) > ['list.txt']), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: ((Tono do: ['this'], a: ['that'])), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: ((Ara go: ['here'], a: ['there'])), rārangi-hou.